  "body": "Welcome to your dream coastal retreat — just 200 metres from the golden sands of Orewa Beach. This two-level, four-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers the perfect blend of space, style, and seaside living.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you’ll find light-filled living areas, a modern kitchen, and plenty of room for family or guests. Upstairs, the bedrooms capture the sea breeze, while downstairs flows effortlessly to your private deck and BBQ area — ideal for summer entertaining.\r\nAdd in internal access garaging for 1 car, plus ample off St for 3 or more cars.\r\n\r\nSituated on the flat, you can stroll to cafés, shops, grassed reserves and the beach in minutes, without a single hill to climb. Whether it’s morning swims, sunset walks, or weekend gatherings, this home puts you right in the heart of Orewa’s relaxed lifestyle.\r\n\r\n\"Here, every day feels like a holiday — and it’s waiting for you.\"",
